 kGlicTrustFirstOnboarding is not enabled. See the constructor of this class for similar examples"],["b380b8ce_65ee0f83",31,-2,1,"add a ForTesting suffix"],["c3bd1909_ca6f40ed",29,-2,0,"Should the web client assume the FRE is completed if these functions do not exist?"],["19912cd4_59aeba79",30,-1,1,"instead of sending a message, just send the initial value in the initial state"],["8421a45c_98fcdc0c",27,-1,1,"normally, we would send the initial state over in WebClientInitialState, then you don't need a function to query the state."],["90d9beb1_9bbabca3",32,-1,1,"don't need this anymore"],["e493a93f_44ba44a6",30,-1,1,"nit: no need to do this conditionally, you're already setting onboardingCompleted unconditionally elsewhere anyway"],["fae4cb4a_6877fc80",33,-1,1,"this isn't needed anymore"]],0,331]]}